OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Spider-Man fan with rare
OL,4,Acondition finally gets to meet his hero
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-year-old boy from Glasgow who
OL,7,Fhas a rare genetic condition was left
OL,8,F"starstruck" after finally getting to
OL,9,Fmeet his hero, the "real" Spider-Man.
OL,11,FNoah Connell was born with Pierre Robin
OL,12,FSyndrome which resulted in facial
OL,13,Fabnormalities which cause problems with
OL,14,Ffeeding and breathing.
OL,16,FHe is a huge fan of the Marvel
OL,17,Fsuperhero and although he managed to
OL,18,Fmeet actor Tom Holland's stunt double
OL,19,Fin costume during filming in Glasgow,
OL,20,Fhe has finally met the man himself.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
